Curious: what Rank (and I suppose Breed/Auspice/Tribe) are your Garou PCs?<br /> <br /> In the end, just set whatever defenses you need to make the story interesting. I mean: if the PCs just can't enter because of Wards, that will make for a boring story.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://drive.google.com/uc?export=view&amp;id=0B9RzepSqCby3Mi1KUmJ5aWUwRVk\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":805,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/805-idpersona","user":"idpersona","date":". 09-25-2017, 02:54 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/805-idpersona","name":"idpersona","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar805_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2117"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-09-25T12:51:54-07:00","id":1143870,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>erSito</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1143728-warding-circle-versus-lupines-in-the-umbra?p=1143825#post1143825\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">Last two, because my Garou PC are about to assault an Tremere-ish haven.</span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">I don't know about the other, but Garous have a reputation for killing everybody around, except what really matters <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/tongue.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Stick Out Tongue\" smilieid=\"5\" class=\"inlineimg\" /></span></span></span></div> </div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> Personally, i think people give too much kindred knowledge to Garou and not enough the other way. Garou are dangerous out of context problems that Kindred go out of their way to avoid. Kindred are generally out of context problems FOR garou they just attacks of opportunity. Hitting stuff like Chantries should be hard and stuff they have no plans for. and STs Should be more than willing add new shit that Players have never seen before ESPECIALLY if they are verterin Vampire players to get the idea that &quot;Vampires are ALIEN&quot;(The same should be true the other way around for Werewolves and Vampires)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2715-lian","name":"Lian","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5218"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-09-25T12:51:54-07:00","id":1143871,"title":"","content":"accidental double post","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2715-lian","name":"Lian","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5218"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-09-26T00:30:52-07:00","id":1143989,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>idpersona</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1143728-warding-circle-versus-lupines-in-the-umbra?p=1143853#post1143853\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Curious: what Rank (and I suppose Breed/Auspice/Tribe) are your Garou PCs?</div> </div> </div> </div> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">Fianna Galliard doing the quest for Rank 3.</span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">Uktena Theurge Rank 2.</span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">Silver Fang AhrounRank 2.</span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">and a Ghural (in Ahrounauspice) Rank 3 (this one will not be affected by the Lupine wards).</span></span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">The haven they're assaulting is not a Tremere chantry, but a haven where some thaumaturgy/occultist investigators have been living for a couple of centuries.</span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">They're attacking during the day, so once they find the vampires they won't be much of a challenge... all the 'fun' it's up to the traps, ghouls and a couple of ghosts.</span></span></span><br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11010-ersito","name":"erSito","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11010_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"119"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-09-26T06:41:16-07:00","id":1144041,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>erSito</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1143728-warding-circle-versus-lupines-in-the-umbra?p=1143989#post1143989\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">Fianna Galliard doing the quest for Rank 3.</span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">Uktena Theurge Rank 2.</span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">Silver Fang AhrounRank 2.</span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">and a Ghural (in Ahrounauspice) Rank 3 (this one will not be affected by the Lupine wards).</span></span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">The haven they're assaulting is not a Tremere chantry, but a haven where some thaumaturgy/occultist investigators have been living for a couple of centuries.</span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">They're attacking during the day, so once they find the vampires they won't be much of a challenge... all the 'fun' it's up to the traps, ghouls and a couple of ghosts.</span></span></span><br /></div> </div> </div> </div>Ah okay. then on the Wards front I wouldn't worry too much about the systems from Vampire. You can have the wards block their way with a difficult Willpower roll (say 8 or 9) but allow them to push passed if they want and just eat the damage of it (which in this case I probably would upgrade to Agg). Or maybe just have the Wards to 3-4 levels of Agg, &quot;soaked&quot; by using Willpower. That would set up a dynamic that doesn't play to Garou's innate strengths but would also allow them to continue with the story (albeit hurt) even if they don't roll well on that single roll.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://drive.google.com/uc?export=view&amp;id=0B9RzepSqCby3Mi1KUmJ5aWUwRVk\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/805-idpersona","name":"idpersona","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar805_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2117"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-09-26T09:12:00-07:00","id":1144093,"title":"","content":"True Story - I played a Silver Fang in a LARP back in 96 or so. We were a City sept and we'd use the Umbra to spy on the local Leeches. Their Tremere would throw up Ward vs Lupines, which did 3 aggravated under MET 1st Edition. Nothing in the ritual text said anything abour forcing entities back, just that the Ward did damage. So, I and a packmate would power up our Luna's Armor (which ate Aggravated damage), took the 3 agg which got eaten by the armor, and happily spied on the Primogen via Peeking who couldn't do shit about it. They'd also try to use Disciplines on us from across the Gauntlet but staff ruled that Disciplines could not cross the Gauntlet. With our City Spirit allies and our canny knowledge of the local Vampire scene, we had no fear of the Leeches.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6358-robert-armsley","name":"Robert Armsley","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar6358_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"72"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-09-26T09:14:33-07:00","id":1144096,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Lian</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1143728-warding-circle-versus-lupines-in-the-umbra?p=1143870#post1143870\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> <br /> <br /> Personally, i think people give too much kindred knowledge to Garou and not enough the other way. Garou are dangerous out of context problems that Kindred go out of their way to avoid. Kindred are generally out of context problems FOR garou they just attacks of opportunity. Hitting stuff like Chantries should be hard and stuff they have no plans for. and STs Should be more than willing add new shit that Players have never seen before ESPECIALLY if they are verterin Vampire players to get the idea that &quot;Vampires are ALIEN&quot;(The same should be true the other way around for Werewolves and Vampires)</div> </div> </div> </div>Correct. Also, remember that most Tremere thaumaturges have zero knowledge of the Umbra, the war of the Triat of any Garou cosmology. The various Spirit oriented Paths are rare in the Pyramid. For the most part, Tremere worry about fighting other Vampires, who are their main enemies.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6358-robert-armsley","name":"Robert Armsley","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar6358_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"72"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-09-27T03:42:07-07:00","id":1144335,"title":"","content":"I think I'm going with:<br /> <br /> Lupine Ward and Warding Circle making 3 dice of Silver damage.<br /> The Ward: they can interact with the object normally, but receiving damage every turn they touch it.<br /> The Warding Circle, does 3 dice of silver damage per attempt to enter, with the WP roll as in the manual. It will also affect the Umbra.<br /> <br /> This may put 2 or 3 Aggravated damage in the PC before they reach the vampires &quot;coffins&quot;.<br /> <br /> Other traps and ghouls only do Lethal damage, garous will heal easily.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11010-ersito","name":"erSito","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11010_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"119"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-09-27T19:20:56-07:00","id":1144600,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Robert Armsley</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1143728-warding-circle-versus-lupines-in-the-umbra?p=1144096#post1144096\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Correct. Also, remember that most Tremere thaumaturges have zero knowledge of the Umbra, the war of the Triat of any Garou cosmology. The various Spirit oriented Paths are rare in the Pyramid. For the most part, Tremere worry about fighting other Vampires, who are their main enemies.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> People always play up this end.. but conversely Garou should know little to nothing about Leeches. Vampires are targets of opportunity but the main targets for your average Garou is Formori, Banes, BSDs.<br /> <br /> And even lack of knowledge of the spirit world doesn't mean if say warding circle didn't work in the Umbra it would probably be noticed how &quot;regularly garou break through it&quot; and they do have spirit manip to have someone figure that out. They may not include &quot;this works in a parallel dimension&quot; as part of the ward circle vs lupines but that doesn't I think matter so much. I also have warding circle vs Kindred keep astral projection out so.<br /> <br /> And a Tremere chantry is going to attract all sorts of scary weird wyrmy spirits. Its probably going to have a decently high Gauntlet from the general taint from a bunch of vampires conducting unholy experiments regularly in the same place.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2715-lian","name":"Lian","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5218"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"d